# GraphSurya

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphSurya } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphSurya
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={60}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphSurya
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={60}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | Caption drawn on the top edge as `[ TITLE ]`. Uppercase, 1–2 words. |
| `animated?` | `boolean` | `true` | Animate the day cycle. Default true. Reduced motion freezes a mid-morning frame. |
| `cols?` | `number` | `60` | Width of the scene in characters. Default 60. |
| `rows?` | `number` | `18` | Height of the scene in rows. Default 18. |
| `speedMs?` | `number` | `120` | Milliseconds per tick. Default 120. |
| `rays?` | `number` | `12` | Number of spokes on the wheel. Default 12. |
| `seedNum?` | `number` | `5` | Seed for the per-spoke length jitter. Default 5. |
| `label?` | `string` | `'the mover of days'` | Short caption under the art; the art itself is decorative. |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphSuryaProps`

## Reduced motion

Animation is disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
